cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OpenSiro VSM Harness Index assessments, cite this corpus and identify the exact Git commit or immutable snapshot used."
title: "OpenSiro VSM Harness Index"
authors:
  - name: "OpenSiro contributors"
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  Versioned-through-Git corpus of evidence-backed VSM assessments of agent
  harnesses. The Index owns assessment records and provenance, not VSM Profile
  semantics or the released assessment methodology.
repository-code: "https://github.com/opensiro/vsm-harness-index"
url: "https://github.com/opensiro/vsm-harness-index"
keywords:
  - "agent harness"
  - "Viable System Model"
  - "assessment corpus"
  - "research dataset"
